    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MS. HUSSA: All right girls, you are just behind the gate, don't laugh so loudly. Women's voices shouldn't carry outside the door!\nFATIMA: Sorry, Ms. Hussa.\nFATIN: It won’t happen again.\nMS. HUSSA: Wajda!",
      "NOURA: This is for you.\nMS. HUSSA: Thank you for your feelings, but you know you are not supposed to bring flowers to school.",
      "WAJDA: I thought about what you said. I was wrong and am ready to change. I would like to join the religious club.\nMS. HUSSA: You are becoming a Shiekha all of a sudden?\nWAJDA: Maybe I'll learn something. You know… to put me on the righteous path.\nMS. HUSSA: I will call your Mother tomorrow and speak to her about this. If we agree, it’s your last chance.",
      "WAJDA AND HER MOTHER: Why did you leave? You forgot our nights? I'll write you a love letter…\nWAJDA: So I've saved up 87 riyals already and I only need 413 to get the bicyc--",
      "WAJDA: I'll let you onto the roof if you bring your bicycle.\nLEILA: Hey Wajda, it's me Leila.\nLEILA: You look so grown up and cute!\nLEILA: Can you call your Mother? The bus is waiting."
    ]
